{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：09:46 2026-11-15 HKT<br/>發佈時間：09:15 2026-11-15 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：09:15 2026-11-15 HKT</p><img alt=\"黃大仙下邨單位起火，居民逃生。右圖：梁國峰攝；左圖：fb「黃大仙區友(黃大仙，新蒲崗，鑽石山，慈雲山......)」圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9b3143ccba0df10f56fc3a9b8b1a95fc/2026-11/FotoJet_1__3.jpg\"/><p>今日（15日）早上8時47分，黃大仙下邨龍光樓一單位發生火警，多名居民報案，並指有爆炸聲傳出。消防員接報到場，出動一條喉及一隊煙帽隊灌救，至早上9時16分將火救熄。事件中沒有人受傷，約50人需要疏散，火警原因有待調查。</p><img alt=\"消防員到場救火。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/45eb8ec7af3ad15b445df3ffaa78d905/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_09_27_00_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"居民走火警。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/9e4d0201069dceb5b68c26bcb9109a76/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_09_27_00_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/c8519a27c89534ca380a8543176951c5/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_09_27_00.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"約50名居民疏散。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/009a7d7bd18ff3d2b89fbfe6cec07ef0/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_09_26_59.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"居民到安全地方暫避。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/bc97f9d0886afeecd5176accc0ae4f10/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_09_27_02.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/b76c1bbe36743f57b84ad5fe6c842ad5/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_09_27_01_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/5b903e28b3d625cfb3a3ad5a1b275c0e/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_09_27_01_1_.jpeg\"/><p>龍光樓11樓居民吳小姐帶同貓咪逃生。她講述走火警經過，指當時她在家中嗅到煙味，並聽到火警鐘響起，於是致電樓下保安員查詢。當她知道發生火警後，連忙帶同貓咪離家逃生。她形容：「貓咪都好驚，所以要入籠遮住佢」，但指走火警沿樓梯下樓期間，情況並不混亂。</p><img alt=\"fb「黃大仙區友(黃大仙，新蒲崗，鑽石山，慈雲山......)」圖片\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f3286d2356090ba627930f942d3d1ae0/2026-11/6_1_32.jpg\"/><img alt=\"有居民帶同寵物逃生。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/98355bb14e4fd737a4f5c89a6bf9a3fe/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_09_36_45_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"吳小姐講述火警經過。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/9aa8d728856fbf9ad302236c7969ba45/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_09_36_44.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"起火單位熏黑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/24f4599f655b4c9a8b54a23b6bbc0651/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_09_36_11_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"起火單位熏黑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/9cd5876a503b1da57d70a3c4abb3c4dc/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_09_36_11.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"起火單位熏黑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/64b934d6f11a90f03d6161a18fe02311/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_09_36_09.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場是黃大仙下邨。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/a039dcd4bec7f52a8eba3ffd05096c8e/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-15_at_09_36_10_1_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T02:13:56.075187+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":315,"images":15,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T01:46:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T02:07:19.192909+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T02:07:19.192909+00:00","content_hash":"6bb48edfa8130d92b20bb9caf9f2d7add418d05b668e6113f881ff9800ef087f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}